01:31:04.923 --> 01:31:07.531
with "Death Note", "Code
Geass", "Fullmetal Alchemist."

01:31:07.531 --> 01:31:08.883
I'm like, "Sick, these are great."

01:31:08.883 --> 01:31:10.794
