01:31:10.794 --> 01:31:12.443
You literally spoiled all
of anime for yourself.

01:31:12.443 --> 01:31:13.892
- Yeah.
- No I did not.

01:31:13.892 --> 01:31:14.850
I had a great time.

01:31:14.850 --> 01:31:15.865
And then I started getting into shows-

01:31:15.865 --> 01:31:18.648
