is that no other anime,

01:31:18.648 --> 01:31:20.472
that just is a normal anime,

01:31:20.472 --> 01:31:21.492
is just going to live
up to those standards.

01:31:21.492 --> 01:31:22.325
- Yeah, exactly.

01:31:22.325 --> 01:31:23.991
- Yeah, so then I started
watching shows and I'm like,

01:31:23.991 --> 01:31:25.382
"Wait, why didn't this end?"

01:31:25.382 --> 01:31:26.259
(Joey laughs)

01:31:26.259 --> 01:31:27.092
Where's the ending?

01:31:27.092 --> 01:31:28.628
And this is when, this is how, you know,

01:31:28.628 --> 01:31:30.804
everyone else had the
same desperation as me.

01:31:30.804 --> 01:31:32.546
'Cause whenever you type in the show,

01:31:32.546 --> 01:31:33.933
the first auto-fillers,

01:31:33.933 --> 01:31:36.207
"When is season three
coming out of this show?"

01:31:36.207 --> 01:31:39.094
"There are no plans for
season three of this show."

01:31:39.094 --> 01:31:39.927
