01:31:49.573 --> 01:31:51.197
There's season 2 coming right?

01:31:51.197 --> 01:31:52.030
Right?

01:31:52.030 --> 01:31:52.863
Right!"

01:31:52.863 --> 01:31:53.763
- Never happened.

01:31:53.763 --> 01:31:55.204
- And then this is when
I started to realize...

01:31:55.204 --> 01:31:58.364
