is that he doesn't teach academic lessons.

02:11:09.134 --> 02:11:10.740
He teaches life lessons.

02:11:10.740 --> 02:11:12.407
And I know sounds-

02:11:12.407 --> 02:11:13.949
- How do I reach these kids?

02:11:13.949 --> 02:11:15.265
- He ain't book smart.

02:11:15.265 --> 02:11:16.765
He's street smart.

02:11:17.623 --> 02:11:18.856
- This is how you wear bag kids,

02:11:18.856 --> 02:11:21.118
making you shoulder it correctly.

02:11:21.118 --> 02:11:24.909
- But like it's a manga that
I think really affected me

02:11:24.909 --> 02:11:26.743
when I read this as like a teenager,

02:11:26.743 --> 02:11:31.224
because you know, it is like
a completely cheesy kind

02:11:31.224 --> 02:11:32.557
of setup, right.

02:11:33.435 --> 02:11:34.268
Because you know, it's just,

02:11:34.268 --> 02:11:37.409
"Oh, it's a teacher who
reforms a problematic classroom

02:11:37.409 --> 02:11:39.259
and teaches them life lessons.

02:11:39.259 --> 02:11:40.975
It makes them appreciate life and stuff."

02:11:40.975 --> 02:11:43.070
And yeah, that's exactly it.

02:11:43.070 --> 02:11:46.518
It's probably the best feel
good manga I've ever read.

02:11:46.518 --> 02:11:48.237
- Japan loves those
kinds of mangas though.

02:11:48.237 --> 02:11:50.420
There's another manga like
that called "Rookies."

02:11:50.420 --> 02:11:52.184
I don't know if you know that one.

02:11:52.184 --> 02:11:53.017
- I don't.

02:11:53.017 --> 02:11:54.400
- It's like if you took GTO

02:11:54.400 --> 02:11:57.363
but you made them play baseball.

02:11:57.363 --> 02:11:59.365
And, but it's like, it's
the exact same, like,

02:11:59.365 --> 02:12:00.288
feel good vibe.

02:12:00.288 --> 02:12:02.341
You have the delinquent teacher
who like teaches a bunch of

02:12:02.341 --> 02:12:04.682
delinquents to like join a baseball team

02:12:04.682 --> 02:12:05.515
and stuff like that.

02:12:05.515 --> 02:12:06.428
- [Connor] Yeah.

02:12:06.428 --> 02:12:07.261
- Exact same feel as GTO.

02:12:07.261 --> 02:12:08.152
It's like just as good.

02:12:08.152 --> 02:12:09.649
- It's just, it's just really,

02:12:09.649 --> 02:12:10.574
it's also a comedy one.

02:12:10.574 --> 02:12:12.542
And I do like the comedy, but like,

02:12:12.542 --> 02:12:15.114
what I really love is that, you know,

02:12:15.114 --> 02:12:18.632
it doesn't teach you so much
cheesy life lessons, right?

02:12:18.632 --> 02:12:23.187
It's so much, it's just
teaches you that you,

02:12:23.187 --> 02:12:25.238
especially growing up in Asian culture,

02:12:25.238 --> 02:12:26.962
it tries to teach you that, you know,

02:12:26.962 --> 02:12:29.728
grades and you're like
this, the school system,

02:12:29.728 --> 02:12:32.483
isn't what defines you as a person.

02:12:32.483 --> 02:12:35.424
And I feel like a lot of
people might need to like hear

02:12:35.424 --> 02:12:37.510
some of the things that
this manga has to say.

02:12:37.510 --> 02:12:38.343
- Especially in Japan.

02:12:38.343 --> 02:12:39.201
- Especially in Japan.

02:12:39.201 --> 02:12:40.668
And especially in Asian culture.

02:12:40.668 --> 02:12:45.055
And kind of the cherry on
top is just how fucking goofy

02:12:45.055 --> 02:12:47.953
and at the same time bad ass Onizuka is.

02:12:47.953 --> 02:12:51.469
I fucking, seeing the
antics they put him through

02:12:51.469 --> 02:12:53.760
is just like everything is such a treat.

02:12:53.760 --> 02:12:57.121
Like one of my favorite
scenes in the manga,

02:12:57.121 --> 02:12:58.781
which never got adapted
to the anime was like,

02:12:58.781 --> 02:13:02.647
he was trying to teach
this like this leader

02:13:02.647 --> 02:13:06.429
of like this gang to
like try to attend school

02:13:06.429 --> 02:13:09.120
and take it fucking
seriously and all that shit.

02:13:09.120 --> 02:13:12.811
And so this guy, this student leads him

02:13:12.811 --> 02:13:14.646
to like this underground,

02:13:14.646 --> 02:13:16.033
like fight ring or something.

02:13:16.033 --> 02:13:18.416
I can't remember the exact
setup, but he's just like,

02:13:18.416 --> 02:13:22.268
"Look, if I arm wrestle
a hundred of you and win,

02:13:22.268 --> 02:13:25.118
then you got to come to school."

02:13:25.118 --> 02:13:26.649
And it's just like,

02:13:26.649 --> 02:13:28.671
this is so fucking stupid, right.

02:13:28.671 --> 02:13:29.843
Because it's just like,

02:13:29.843 --> 02:13:32.629
how are you going to fucking
arm wrestle a hundred people.

02:13:32.629 --> 02:13:34.665
And then he, he beats one person.

02:13:34.665 --> 02:13:35.498
He beats two persons.

02:13:35.498 --> 02:13:36.331
He beat...

02:13:36.331 --> 02:13:37.843
He starts taking on three at a time.

02:13:37.843 --> 02:13:38.676
And like-

02:13:38.676 --> 02:13:39.509
- Three at a time?

02:13:39.509 --> 02:13:40.342
- Yeah, yeah.

02:13:40.342 --> 02:13:41.175
He starts taking on three at a time.

02:13:41.175 --> 02:13:42.792
It's Shonen manga okay.

02:13:42.792 --> 02:13:44.345
And he's just like,

02:13:44.345 --> 02:13:46.511
the way that it just kind of builds up

02:13:46.511 --> 02:13:51.077
and like escalates is
like hilarious and bad-ass

02:13:51.077 --> 02:13:52.102
at the same time.

02:13:52.102 --> 02:13:52.935
- Yeah.

02:13:52.935 --> 02:13:55.483
- And it's, it's something
where it's not 100% serious,

02:13:55.483 --> 02:13:57.766
but when it hits, it fucking hits.

02:13:57.766 --> 02:13:59.569
And some like,

02:13:59.569 --> 02:14:01.851
it's a manga that can really,

02:14:01.851 --> 02:14:04.144
I wouldn't say change a person, but it...

02:14:04.144 --> 02:14:06.410
If you're looking for
something that affects you

02:14:06.410 --> 02:14:08.010
in the opposite way of "Punpun."

02:14:08.010 --> 02:14:09.518
Where it's just like, "Wow"-

02:14:09.518 --> 02:14:10.876
- It uses comedy to teach you.

02:14:10.876 --> 02:14:12.142
- Yeah.
- Not depression.

02:14:12.142 --> 02:14:12.975
- Yeah, it still teaches you

02:14:12.975 --> 02:14:14.525
like very important life lessons,

02:14:14.525 --> 02:14:16.363
but you feel wholesome at the day.

02:14:16.363 --> 02:14:17.748
You don't want to cry.

02:14:17.748 --> 02:14:18.864
- I feel like that genre of manga

02:14:18.864 --> 02:14:22.122
is so like beloved and known and quite,

02:14:22.122 --> 02:14:25.593
you know, more common, especially
to a Japanese audience.

02:14:25.593 --> 02:14:27.486
I feel it's slept on in the West.

02:14:27.486 --> 02:14:28.419
- Really?

02:14:28.419 --> 02:14:29.587
- Like there are so many like good,

02:14:29.587 --> 02:14:31.466
like feel-good comedy centered,

02:14:31.466 --> 02:14:34.445
like delinquent life lesson
type of manga that is out there.

02:14:34.445 --> 02:14:35.305
And they're all fucking great.

02:14:35.305 --> 02:14:37.705
- Yeah because, I feel like
to do this type of manga,

02:14:37.705 --> 02:14:38.696
or to do this type of story,

02:14:38.696 --> 02:14:40.779
it's so hard to just not be cheesy.

02:14:40.779 --> 02:14:41.905
- Yeah, true.

02:14:41.905 --> 02:14:42.738
- You know, like.

02:14:42.738 --> 02:14:44.338
And I feel like GTO is that one manga

02:14:44.338 --> 02:14:47.394
when I'm just like you see
this done in any other way

02:14:47.394 --> 02:14:48.260
and it would just be cheesy.

02:14:48.260 --> 02:14:51.360
But, the way that they do
it in this, just it doesn't-

02:14:51.360 --> 02:14:53.015
- It almost doesn't take
itself seriously always.

02:14:53.015 --> 02:14:53.848
- Yeah, yeah.

02:14:53.848 --> 02:14:54.681
Exactly.

02:14:56.023 --> 02:14:57.910
So, yeah, Onizuka like,

02:14:57.910 --> 02:15:00.218
I think one of my favorite
characters in manga

02:15:00.218 --> 02:15:01.551
for that reason.

02:15:02.910 --> 02:15:04.353
What'd you want to go on next?

02:15:04.353 --> 02:15:06.021
