The main character looks like Ichigo.

02:20:09.927 --> 02:20:10.777
- Yeah, yeah.

02:20:10.777 --> 02:20:12.562
It kind of looks so generic,

02:20:12.562 --> 02:20:14.112
but it has so many original ideas.

02:20:14.112 --> 02:20:15.870
Like I've really liked without spoiling

02:20:15.870 --> 02:20:17.438
what the main character's power is.

02:20:17.438 --> 02:20:18.296
So like anyone who goes to this world

02:20:18.296 --> 02:20:20.734
gets a special power of their own, right.

02:20:20.734 --> 02:20:23.039
And I like as an engineer,

02:20:23.039 --> 02:20:24.472
he has like a really unique power

